  "subject": "A young home-care nurse from Taipei whose only Taigi is what her mother shouted at her as a child (eat up, hurry, put a jacket on) finds on her Pingtung scooter rounds that it is exactly what her old patients want to hear.",
  "caption": "Taiwanese Hokkien string-quartet baroque pop, brisk chamber-pop with harpsichord. String quartet playing staccato eighth-note chords with a cello counter-melody; harpsichord broken-chord arpeggios; oboe singing obbligato between vocal lines; upright piano bouncing quarter-note chords; brushed snare with tambourine in a light backbeat. Intimate chamber-room mix, bright strings, dry vocal. Female soprano, bright clear full voice with crisp consonants, clearly sung melody, not breathy. Clear full voice, every word enunciated, steady sung melody on every line. 96 BPM, F major. Brisk, bossy-tender, quietly moved. No rap, no electric guitar, no synth pads, no autotune, no trap hi-hats.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n阮阿母 細漢罵我的話\n食乎飽 緊咧 穿較燒咧\n我干焦會記得 這幾句\n台北的厝 無人講台語\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n屏東的庄跤 機車咧踅\n我敲門 就開喙\n\n[Chorus]\n穿較燒咧 食乎飽\n阿公阿嬤 笑甲目睭瞇\n我講的 攏是阿母的話\n伊講 你阿母 教甲真好\n\n[Verse]\n阿嬤的血壓 愈量愈懸\n我講 緊咧 食藥仔\n伊就乖乖 吞落去\n比醫生的話 閣較有效\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n阿公捀一粒 柑仔\n塞入我的手 講緊食咧\n\n[Chorus]\n穿較燒咧 食乎飽\n阿公阿嬤 笑甲目睭瞇\n我講的 攏是阿母的話\n伊講 你阿母 閣較真勢\n\n[Verse]\n天寒的暗頭仔 我騎車轉\n想起彼條 舊外衫\n阿母佇門跤口 等我\n手裡捀著 一碗燒湯\n\n[Bridge]\n電話撥過去 我講\n阿母 你食飽未\n\n[Chorus]\n穿較燒咧 食乎飽\n這兩句 我今仔日才曉\n我講的 攏是阿母的話\n原來 攏是 伊對我的好\n\n[Outro]\n穿較燒咧\n食乎飽 緊咧",
